04)------Aggregate: groupBy=[[cs1.cs_order_number AS alias1]], aggr=[[sum(cs1.cs_ext_ship_cost) AS alias2, sum(cs1.cs_net_profit) AS alias3]]
05)--------LeftAnti Join: cs1.cs_order_number = __correlated_sq_2.cr_order_number
06)----------Projection: cs1.cs_order_number, cs1.cs_ext_ship_cost, cs1.cs_net_profit
07)------------LeftSemi Join: cs1.cs_order_number = __correlated_sq_1.cs_order_number Filter: cs1.cs_warehouse_sk != __correlated_sq_1.cs_warehouse_sk
08)--------------Projection: cs1.cs_warehouse_sk, cs1.cs_order_number, cs1.cs_ext_ship_cost, cs1.cs_net_profit
09)----------------Inner Join: cs1.cs_call_center_sk = call_center.cc_call_center_sk
10)------------------Projection: cs1.cs_call_center_sk, cs1.cs_warehouse_sk, cs1.cs_order_number, cs1.cs_ext_ship_cost, cs1.cs_net_profit
11)--------------------Inner Join: cs1.cs_ship_addr_sk = customer_address.ca_address_sk
12)----------------------Projection: cs1.cs_ship_addr_sk, cs1.cs_call_center_sk, cs1.cs_warehouse_sk, cs1.cs_order_number, cs1.cs_ext_ship_cost, cs1.cs_net_profit
13)------------------------Inner Join: cs1.cs_ship_date_sk = date_dim.d_date_sk
